Cell["\<\
The shifts to the coordinate time and azimuthal trajectories diverge \
logarithmically at the periastron, as the corresponding geodesic trajectories\
\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.967781048769547*^9, 3.967781084933509*^9}, {
  3.967781133401545*^9, 3.967781134224859*^9}, {3.967798197633613*^9, 
